NOTE ON DATASETS
================
This license applies ONLY to the source code and documentation in this
repository. The COG-BCI dataset (Hinss et al., 2023) and STEW dataset
(Lim et al., 2018) are governed by their respective licenses:

  - COG-BCI: CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
    citation: doi:10.1038/s41597-022-01898-y
